{"id":"wb-5-357","name":"中岳庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"中岳庙","text":"中岳庙，道教宫观，位于河南省登封市嵩山太室山东麓，始建于秦代，已有2000多年历史。是道教全真道的圣地，也是历代皇帝祭祀中岳神的地方。总面积达11万平方米，居中原各祠宇之冠，亦是五岳中现存规模最大、保存相对比较完整的古建筑群。2010年8月1日联合国教科文组织将包括中岳庙在内的登封“天地之中”历史建筑群列为世界文化遗产。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E5%B2%B3%E5%BA%99","revisionId":92623403,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92623403","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0703d62ff0b72c1731fe6cd0.jpg","title":"20260120_Zhongyue_Temple_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260120_Zhongyue_Temple_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cd/20260120_Zhongyue_Temple_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​雪中的登封中岳庙","width":320,"height":214}}